# What preview.lua needs from outside Hammerspoon, declared beside the only file that
# runs these tools. manager/init.lua passes the resolved paths in, it never runs them.
# Format is name | kind | locator | policy | reason.
# See Dependencies.spoon for the kinds and for how these files are found.
#
# The macOS built ins this file also uses, sips and head, are not declared. They ship with
# every install, so they are not a credible failure point, and declaring them would be
# noise. The Xcode command line tools are different and are declared where used.
ffmpeg  | path | ffmpeg  | optional | video clipboard previews
ffprobe | path | ffprobe | optional | reading a video duration so a preview frame is picked mid clip
